[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Initiation</h2>
<i>"To start is easy, to finish is another thing entirly."<br>
-- High Priest Jatol</i>  
<p>You have been choosen to be the pupil of Kalrek, Nimbian High Priest and Sun Master.  If you succeed you shall become a high priest of Nimbus, the greatest honour a Nimbian can have!

$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0
$Button=Finished,Tell,objective1

[@1]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>This is your first test.  You journy to become a High Priest of Nimbus shall begin here, or will end before it has even started.
