[@2]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>Your task is to sacrafice the priest on the other end of the island.
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@3]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>If you succeed I shall teach you the ways of the Priesthood of Nimbus.
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@4]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>You have 5 minutes to compleate this task.  Once you are done report to me.  Do not waste my time.
$Timeout=7,DoNothing,0

[@300]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>ENOUGH!  You have wasted enough of my time!  Begone from my sight!
$Button=Failed!,Tell,failed
$Timeout=5,Tell,failed

