[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]


[ai3PriestCaptured]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>Very good, but you are only half done your task.
$Timeout=4,DoNothing,0

[ai3PriestDead]
<$Config,atobjective1=1>


[tech0]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>Well done, but you shall have to do much more than sacrafice a helpless priest to impress me.
$Button=Ok,Tell,tech1
$Timeout=6,Tell,tech1

[tech1]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>Now that your first step into the world of Priesthood is compleate you have a choice to make.
$Button=Ok,Tell,tech2
$Timeout=6,Tell,tech2

[tech2]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>You must decide which fury you shall worship first.  This choice will effect the course of your destiny as a High Priest of Nimbus.  

$Button=Ok,Tell,tech3
$Timeout=8,Tell,tech3

[tech3]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>Choose wisely
$Menu=~wWind,Tell,windfury
$Menu=~wRain,Tell,rainfury
$Menu=~wThunder,Tell,thunderfury

[windfury]
<$Config,atweapon1=1>
<$Config,atweapon7=0>
<$Config,atweapon14=0>
<$Config,atfurywind=1>
$Timeout=0,Tell,tech4

[rainfury]
<$Config,atweapon1=0>
<$Config,atweapon7=1>
<$Config,atweapon14=0>
<$Config,atfuryrain=1>
$Timeout=0,Tell,tech4

[thunderfury]
<$Config,atweapon1=0>
<$Config,atweapon7=0>
<$Config,atweapon14=1>
<$Config,atfurythunder=1>
$Timeout=0,Tell,tech4

[tech4]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>Very Well.  Now I shall give you knowledge of one of two technolgies.
$Menu=~wSun Cannon,Tell,cannon
$Menu=~wSun Archer,Tell,archer

[cannon]
<$Config,atweapon20=1>
<$Config,atweapon21=0>
$Timeout=0,Tell,tech5

[archer]
<$Config,atweapon21=1>
<$Config,atweapon20=0>
$Timeout=0,Tell,tech5

[tech5]
$Timeout=0,Tell,SaveTech

[tech6]
