$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,palace2

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>You have brought shame and dishonour to yourself.  You were not prepared and so you paid for it.  Condemmed to live the rest of your life to serving that whom did what you failed to do.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0

